$ redis-cli -p 7206 MEMORY USAGE p:12345
250
$ redis-cli -p 7206 STRLEN p:12345
200
bytes/key from used_memory delta: 273.49536
correction: baseline after FLUSHALL was used_memory 1157072, so delta/100000 = 271.27264 bytes per key-value pair (key ~7 bytes, value 200 bytes), i.e. ~64 bytes of overhead beyond key+value (200+7). MEMORY USAGE reports 250.

